<title>CHINA: Wing Sung H1 net down 4.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Wing Sung H1 net down 4.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	 (in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover		  101.254	  vs     111.548</p>
<p> Net profit		  9.496	  vs	 9.981</p>
<p> Earnings per share    0.098 yuan    vs    0.102 yuan</p>
<p> Net assets per share  3.34 yuan     vs    3.26 yuan</p>
<p>Note: the figures were unaudited. Wing Sung</p>
<p>is China's second biggest manufacturer of fountain pens.</p>
</text>
